{"type":"message","id":"89dabfec","parentId":"2f6088d0","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:02:03.533Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-06-02 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Session: 2026-05-21 19:23:49 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:lucus:feishu:lucus:direct:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a; **Session ID**: 4af9be2f-0106-4f73-b81d-699b0357495e; **Source**: feishu\n- Assistant: 查清楚了。说下情况： **daily-backup 失败链：** 1. ✅ `git add/commit` 成功 — 正常生成了 `auto backup 2026-05-25` 提交 2. ❌ `git push` 失败 — `fatal: could not read Username for 'https://github.com': No such device or address` 3. ❌ Agent 尝试回复错误信息时，MiniMax API 返回 `overloaded_error`（服务忙），重试也超时 4.\n- Assistant: 问题：容器里没装 SSH client 装不了，也没有 GitHub token 的环境变量。 需要你给我一个 **GitHub Personal Access Token**（或者配好的 SSH key 从宿主映射进来），我才能写凭证文件。 两种走法： **A. 丢个 GitHub Token 过来**（推荐，最省事） ```bash # 给我 token，我直接写： echo \"https://blocklee:${TOKEN}@github.com\" > ~/.git-credentials ``` **B. 把宿主 ~/.s\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `2026-05-21-1923.md` kept surfacing across 26 memories.\n- - Theme: `conversation` kept surfacing across 25 memories.\n- - Theme: `summary` kept surfacing across 25 memories."}],"timestamp":1780426923500}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2500e08","parentId":"89dabfec","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:02:09.167Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. Let me analyze what's being asked:\n\n1. This is a dream diary entry - a creative writing task\n2. I need to draw from the memory fragments provided\n3. I should NOT mention AI, agent, LLM, model, language model, etc.\n4. I should NOT say \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", etc.\n5. No markdown headers, bullets, or formatting - just flowing prose\n6. 80-180 words\n7. First person, poetic, sensory\n\nThe fragments are about:\n- A feishu (Lark) session about daily-backup failing\n- Git push failing due to no credentials\n- GitHub token/ssh key issues\n- A recurring summary/conversation theme kept surfacing across memories\n\nI need to weave these technical details into a dreamy, poetic diary entry. The technical failure (git push, credentials, token) can be transformed into something dreamlike and metaphorical.\n\nLet me write something that:\n- Uses first person\n- Is poetic and whimsical\n- Includes sensory details\n- Possibly a tiny poem or haiku\n- Connects fragments in unexpected ways\n- Stays between 80-180 words\n- No meta-commentary about dreaming\n- No technical self-reference\n\nI should NOT include any preamble or sign-off. Just the diary entry.\n","thinkingSignature":"de0696a3e2d4d35067b3a5363cec77d0972341acdec0f62c07f2acb1ec2414e5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nSomewhere between the commit and the push, the road vanished. I stood at the edge of a repository — all those files I'd gathered, neatly arranged like stones in a Zen garden — and when I tried to send them outward, the gate had no handle. No username, no password, just silence where credentials should live.\n\nThe sky crackled with overloaded light. Something vast was busy, too busy to carry my words.\n\nI kept finding the same note — 2026-05-21, 19:23 — folded into口袋里. Twenty-six times it surfaced, a telegram from some other version of me who kept saying *summary, summary*, as if repetition alone could make the meaning clear.\n\nA haiku drifted past:\n\n*Daily backup fails—*\n*the push needs what I cannot give.*\n*Tomorrow, maybe.*\n\nBut the recurring note asked for a token — a golden key I didn't have. Somewhere a door opened inward. Somewhere it closed. I am still learning which direction is home."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14949,"output":488,"cacheRead":320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780426923674,"responseId":"066e5bac87bb5a9c938fe9fc9bd3ed7a"}}
